# RQ1 evaluation: strengths and weaknesses by traffic condition (137, validation weekdays)

480 clean hours on 20 days x 1 simulation seeds (seed-averaged per hour). Y = sum of critical flow ratios from the field counts. Intervals: 95 % day-bootstrap. **Limitations (137, 2026-11-16):** uncalibrated driver model; GDOT timing not yet field-validated; WB through from the upstream signal 138; EB/WB right turns run as through; P2/P6 stop-bar presence added in the model; coordinated corridor site (138 at ~260 m) modelled isolated; no pedestrian timing (atsc/sites/137/README.md). Main tables: learnt controllers at one training seed (lstdq_v2_s0 = LSTDQ, qlearn_s0, ars_s0); all training seeds of every learner are in the training-seed tables (simulation seed 1).

Hours per condition: light (Y < 0.15) 120, moderate (0.15-0.30) 54, busy (0.30-0.40) 87, heavy (Y >= 0.40) 219

